+"""v7.0.98: a blocked Resume must describe the request it is actually blocked on.
+
+Field case (job 20261022-143856-7-small-daily-habits-tha-9729, 2026-10-26 15:17 IST): the only unresolved
+journal was a **video** take (``flow/shots/shot_014/take_01.mp4``), yet the Queue panel said
+
+    Image requests cost no Flow credits, so ONE fresh image request may be submitted without credit
+    approval: `python3 cli.py v3 archive-request <job> flow/shots/shot_014/take_01.mp4`
